Measure producer capacity waits separately for the VU1-to-GS ring and GS backend chunk queue.
GOW_SYNC_DIAG=1 enables bounded wall-time counts/maxima; disabled paths read no clocks.
Queue 1 reports bytes; queue 2 reports chunks. These are not CPU/GPU utilization or frame time.
Preserve queue limits, ordering, synchronization and rendering. No FPS gain claimed.

